WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.488
Here's what the kit ships.

2
00:00:01.488 --> 00:00:06.721
The config access folder holds two automatic
policies, one per department package,

3
00:00:06.721 --> 00:00:11.726
each written on the organization code and
the worker type, with a seven-day grace.

4
00:00:11.726 --> 00:00:16.123
And one request policy for infrastructure
administrator eligibility,

5
00:00:16.123 --> 00:00:18.762
which the manager
approves, with a fallback.

6
00:00:18.762 --> 00:00:23.150
It grants eligibility only; the
role is activated through PIM.

7
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:27.163
Each file's program block records
its tier and the groups it grants.

8
00:00:27.163 --> 00:00:31.705
A small evaluator reads only the
rule operators these policies use,

9
00:00:31.705 --> 00:00:34.200
and raises an error on anything else.
